      "content": "that makes sense. i think i get the vibration part now. but when you say /s/ is just \"airflow\" and /z/ is \"buzzy\", is there a way to actually feel it? like if i put my hand on my throat, how do the two sounds feel different? i'm trying to make sure i can identify them when listening to recordings.",
